WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:04.940
Before I knew it, the rainy season was upon us.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.190
I feel like something warm today.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.660
I greet a stray cat on my way to school.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.370
These are all normal occurrences in my everyday life.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:23.670
But I think I managed to get a bit closer to my kouhai, Honda-san.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.840
It's been nearly three months since I was appointed president.

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.300
I think I'm somehow getting the hang of it.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.340
President!

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:37.050
What's the matter, Honda-san?

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.760
President...

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:45.900
If I could no longer draw, would you all hate me?

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.840
Would you abandon me?

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:49.360
Um...

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:56.980
President, would you go away? Would you still be my president?

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:01.080
Honda-san,

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.650
This is not the place... let's go to school first.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:05.440
Did she make her cry?

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.560
Such a cute girl...

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.500
A lovers' dispute?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.300
A slump?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:35.960
Yes.

00:02:35.960 --> 00:02:40.180
I was thinking of how good that girl from the other day was at drawing,

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.180
and I just couldn't draw anymore.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:45.350
And then I had this nightmare tonight...

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:52.730
If Honda Tamaki can't draw, she's of no use to the SNS Club anymore.

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:54.360
Yay! Yay!

00:02:55.610 --> 00:03:00.280
Sorry, Honda-san.
I choose to be with her.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:04.330
Wait, president! Wait! Don't go!

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.040
P-President! You're coughing blood?

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.660
I-I'm fine.

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.440
I just choked a bit.

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:20.970
What should I say? "You'll be out of it soon"...

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.350
I don't really know that, and I can't guarantee it.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:31.170
For starters, you should get her out of your mind. We have tests coming up too.

00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:33.270
Yes, I'll try.

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:36.150
I think that piece of advice just made her feel worse.

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:40.900
Programmers don't get slumps, if it were Fujikawa-san or Aya I'm sure-

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:40.900
Oh!

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:45.120
Everyone, listen.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:48.870
This story called "Stardust Intenzione" is such a masterpiece.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:50.830
It deserves to be remembered for all eternity.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.440
I think this sight would've killed Aya.

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:55.460
Minaha-chan!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.840
What are you doing in my classroom?

00:03:57.840 --> 00:04:00.090
My, what a coincidence, Honda Tamaki.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:06.000
I realized that strength is not enough, I also need allies to fight.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.560
That's why I'm promoting this masterpiece.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.850
Are you going to challenge me to another contest?

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:12.640
No.

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:15.060
This time, I'm here for a higher purpose-

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.400
Hey, you...

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.770
What are you doing to Tama-chan?

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:18.820
Yumine?

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:22.400
Ha-san! You're so overbearing with the Illustration Club!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.490
Now you're picking on Tama-chan?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.620
So what have I done?

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.580
Just so you know.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.080
Hikono-kun is totally a seme!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.370
Now, now, don't fight.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:36.960
Yet in spite of that, you...

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:41.340
Huh? Even the author thinks that this pure love can only be Ozu x Hiko.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:46.760
Oh yeah, Yumine is in the Illustration Club too, so they know each other.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.800
Just stick to the formula, okay?!

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.810
Her name's Minaha, therefore "Ha-chan."

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.730
Why did you add "-chan," Honda Tamaki?

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.190
Just who do you think I—

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:58.900
Yes, yes, go back to you own classroom.

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:01.650
I'm sorry about the noise, President.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:02.530
Huh?

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.660
Tama-chan, class is about to start.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:09.800
It seems Honda-san has many friends, so I'm sure she'll be fine.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.160
She doesn't need to resort to getting advice from me.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.520
Good morning, Shii.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:21.750
I couldn't give her any good advice. Rather, I probably made things worse.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.170
I should have tried a different way to cheer her up.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:27.010
I shouldn't have invited her to the SNS Club to begin with.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:27.680
Huh?

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.680
It's no big deal to be in a slump,

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:35.180
as much of a pain as it is.

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.850
I hope she gets out of it.

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:40.900
We can talk about it if she comes to the clubroom.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:42.940
And if she doesn't?

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:44.320
Hey!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.240
Enough with the negative expectations now.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.120
Hey!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.780
Se-Seki-senpai!

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:53.080
Aren't you going in, Honda-san?

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.250
Um...

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.920
I feel like I have no right to.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.630
I mean, when I draw...

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.260
No matter how many pictures I draw, they all come out like this!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:06.670
I can't tell how that's any different from normal.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.860
Say, Honda-san.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:11.800
Do you like me?

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:16.420
I do.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:21.520
During that all-nighter, too, I thought you looked cool working so hard.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:25.530
But is it fine for me to like you?

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:29.240
There's nothing wrong with saying you like something you like.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:34.660
I also like how you try so hard,
both then and now. Okay?

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:39.670
The you from back then is still here, and your right hand is still moving, right?

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:40.750
Yes.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.710
Then you'll out of this slump in no time.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:48.470
By the way, have you had lunch yet?
I made too much, so I'll give you some.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.980
Ah, really?

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.720
I'm no match for that.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.310
Thanks for the meal!

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.400
I'll be going back to my classroom then.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.110
Okay, see you after school.

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:04.020
See you later!

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:09.320
I...

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:13.280
...really think you're better suited to be president.

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:14.530
No way.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.250
I can't pay attention to the small details like you.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:21.000
I actually respect that about you.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.460
Managing our schedule, making plans for the year...

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:27.800
Ah, now that you mention it, about the summer Comiket—

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:31.840
What else? You'd be perfect if only you smiled more.

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:35.510
Oh my, we seem to be falling behind schedule.

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.390
Who's that supposed to be?

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:41.190
Don't say such things, smiling is no trivial matter.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:41.980
Gross.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.360
Ha-chan, lunch break is about to end.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.900
Don't call me Ha-chan! I'm a first year like you.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.070
Eh? Really?

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.780
Just what did you think?!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:52.700
Huh? Did you forget something, Honda-san?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:54.570
I'm sorry about the noise.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.030
Ha-chan said she wanted to go to the clubroom.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:01.660
It's so unfair that only you get to!
I want to meet Iris-sensei too...

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:06.880
Is that the girl from the other day? It's hard to tell without my glasses.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.210
Are you Iris-sensei?

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:15.140
W-well...
that's right, maybe, indeed.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.300
What character are you trying to be?

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:20.260
Your book is my Bible. Please sign it for me!

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:22.600
Gladly...

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:27.890
I'm so happy... it's settled,
I'm joining the SNS Club.

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:31.650
Then, I'll make a game based on this story.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.360
Eh?

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:36.320
What are you deciding on your own?! Also, I'm the one in charge of drawing.

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.160
Oh, Honda-sama does have a point.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.120
No! I want to draw! I want to make it!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:45.420
It's always been my dream to work together with Iris-sensei.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:49.340
In that case, you can both draw, there's no need to fight.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:49.880
Wha—

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:52.420
Huh? Can we really do that?

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:55.130
If the coloring is consistent, it doesn't matter if there are several artists.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.340
Hold on! Hold on!

00:08:56.340 --> 00:09:00.890
Wait a minute! To bring up such an old work,

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:05.980
as a storyteller who lives for the moment, how can I allow that?

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.270
Is there really no way?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:13.030
I have always liked your work,

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:15.490
but because I'm still unskilled and inexperienced in love...

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.620
My heart hurts...

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:20.620
"There's nothing wrong with saying you like something you like." Right?

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.620
This girl...

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.660
That's right!

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:27.880
We didn't make it into summer Comiket, so, even if we make a new game now,

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.460
we won't have a place to publish it.

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.710
Therefore, there is no need to make haste with our work.

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.300
Ah, now that you mention it.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.260
Fujikawa-san is negotiating with an acquaintance's circle...

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:39.550
to let us sell our game with theirs.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.930
So we will be able to publish our newest work at summer Comiket.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.060
Really?

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.310
That's good news, right?

00:09:45.310 --> 00:09:47.980
B-but there's less than two months before that.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.110
The schedule will get too tight again.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:54.400
One more reason not to reject additional staff.

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:56.490
With a second illustrator,

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:58.620
Honda-san's workload will be halved.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:02.370
And since the story is already finished,

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:06.100
our work won't get stuck in the plot stage like last time.

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:11.090
I get it. I understand. I accept.

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.130
It's settled then.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:19.470
Our new work for summer Comiket
will be "Stardust Intenzione".

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:24.010
However! You still have to prove your worth to join our club.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.980
Work together with Honda-san, and see this game through to the end.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:29.770
You can do it, right?

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.190
Yes. I'll do my best!

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.240
Seki-senpai!

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.540
She tried too hard for too long.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.460
The SNS Club will take part in summer Comiket.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.840
It seemed our daily life would change again.

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:58.800
By the way, what is summer Comiket?

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.560
Summer Comiket is...

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:09.100
a large-scale market for doujin works held in the summer.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:12.650
Many businesses set up booths too, and people come from all over the world.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.360
Wow, that sounds impressive.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:21.110
If I'm not careful, Ha-chan might take all the work herself.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:22.820
I've got to work hard!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.040
Good morning.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.250
Good morning. Oh?

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.420
Say, Yumine.

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.840
Was that beautiful girl in our class before?

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.630
Ah, that's Marika-san.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:48.060
Reading this book has changed me. I will live like stardust from now on.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:51.060
You have changed another fate, Seki-senpai!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:57.230
This story depicts the elegance of a Yamato Nadeshiko in love that all girls ought to look up to.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:58.900
I don't remember that!

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:04.370
Um, don't advertise this story too much, I think you should keep this a secret.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:06.830
Why? But it's so good...

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:10.620
Seki-senpai probably doesn't want people to know about this.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:14.580
Y-you don't want to have a lot of Yamato Nadeshiko rivals!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.960
I see! I'll be careful.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:26.600
A girl from our class praised your story, saying it depicts a Yamato Nadeshiko we should look up to.

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:32.520
But you really look pretty,
and you hair is so silky...

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.350
Thank you very much.

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:37.730
I got up at 5 a.m. today to do my hair.

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:39.730
I'm so sleepy because of that.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:41.240
Amazing...

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:44.490
Is being a Yamato Nadeshiko that much trouble?

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.780
Do you mind if I take this chance to sketch you?

00:12:46.780 --> 00:12:48.410
Sure, I'm up for it!

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.540
I'll join in then.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:51.620
What face should I make?

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.460
I guess something shoujo manga-like is best.

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.750
No, your usual face is fine.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:59.040
It seems her personality hasn't changed.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:01.090
Pretty girl looking over her shoulder.

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.840
Oh, you're sketching?

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:03.630
Ah? Yes.

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.640
Isn't her left arm's length a bit off?

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:10.310
Ah, you're right. You know about drawing, Iino-san?

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:12.930
Yeah. My younger sister is
pretty knowledgeable.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:17.230
Come on, stop trying to look and stand still, I'm drawing you!

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:20.360
I'm not moving, I'm just stretching my neck.

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:22.360
Is that part of being a Yamato Nadeshiko?

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:25.820
But your hair really is pretty.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.870
Is it because you're half-foreign?

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:29.780
That has nothing to do with it.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:33.330
You're pretty too, Honda-san. A real Yamato Nadeshiko.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.710
Not at all! My hair's a bit frizzy, as usual.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.250
Do you like wearing your hair long, Honda-san?

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.880
Yes. I want to become a pretty woman.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:49.220
My mama used to wear it long, so I think if I have long, pretty hair, my papa will like it too.

00:13:49.220 --> 00:13:50.180
Right!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:51.580
Let's switch places then!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.900
This is so embarrassing!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.160
Tama-chan, wait.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:13.950
Can you make the ecstatic face of a boy about to lovingly tease another boy?

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:16.250
I've never felt that!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.630
I-I can't become a bride, Papa!

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:24.880
Now, now, calm down a bit.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.170
It can't be helped.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:28.840
Marika-san, can you help Tama-chan?

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:29.940
Okay.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:34.540
Cheer up.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:38.380
Tama-chan, try to hold Marika-san's necktie in a cool way.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.640
Um...

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:43.150
Like this?

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:45.820
We're like a prince and a princess.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.110
Ah, this is good...

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.640
Isn't that quite different from reality?

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.120
Class is starting!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.520
Thanks, Tama-chan.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.230
Aw! I wanted to draw a bit more!

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:03.540
You're pretty good too, Shimizu-san.

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:05.750
Thank you! I may not look like it,

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:11.160
but back in elementary school,
they called me the Alstroemeria of art contests.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:12.900
I thought you were a Yamato Nadeshiko.

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:18.080
That girl can draw better than you. Just what do you think you're—

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.520
Honda-san, what's wrong?

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:24.920
Iino-san.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:27.570
How do you become good at drawing?

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:29.720
Why are you asking me?

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:32.140
What about your sister?

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.970
Ah, my sister...

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:37.080
Lately, she's been drawing every time I look at her.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.290
I see.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:44.670
Just like with studying, I guess if you like it, or if you do it all the time, you'll get better.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.880
All the time... during class too?

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:51.610
Ah, these make my notes easier to read.

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:56.740
But you know, just from looking at others, I can sometimes spot mistakes in sketches.

00:15:56.740 --> 00:15:57.890
I see.

00:15:58.180 --> 00:15:59.710
Honda-san, could it be...

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:01.870
that you've just been copying manga art until now?

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.830
Eh? How could you tell?

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:05.940
I just figured.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.650
It really is like studying.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:12.680
You have to work on the things you don't like and are bad at, too.

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.440
Like, for example...

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:20.420
Paying attention in class.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:37.240
At any rate, the more I draw, the faster I'll improve.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:40.970
Our drawing styles really are completely different.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.500
Ah! Why are you here?

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:46.730
I came to return the book I borrowed from Murakami-senpai.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.190
As she said,

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:53.900
if the coloring is consistent, it somehow won't feel out of place.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.350
If the coloring is consistent?

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.620
Coloring, digital coloring.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:02.580
Don't tell me you don't even know about that?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.220
I think they told me about it during our overnighter.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:11.050
But for the last game, they just used my pictures as they were.

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:13.520
Ah, I see.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.570
Ha-chan, I have a favor to ask!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.480
For the shadow, I'd go for something simple like this.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:30.500
Then we add a new layer on top of the draft, blended with multiply.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:34.010
With a blurry brush,

00:17:34.010 --> 00:17:37.010
we add a bit of reddish orange to her bangs.

00:17:37.010 --> 00:17:39.600
That gives it a lighter appearance.

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:41.990
Oh, I didn't know this technique.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:43.930
And next-

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:45.640
a bit of reflection.

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:50.770
If you add a white edge to hair and other things, it looks much better.

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.690
Ah.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.480
Oh, I thought you'd come.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:56.860
Hello!

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:59.110
I see you two are eager to learn.

00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.660
Are you getting along better?

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:03.430
Th-that's not it!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:05.960
Anyway, I have good news.

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:10.750
We get to display our game at Temawari-san's booth at summer Comiket.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:13.670
Temawari-san? They're pretty famous...

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:16.150
It's that artist Yumine admires.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:20.390
In exchange, we have to help as sales staff.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:25.180
I see. So we've secured a place to make Iris-sensei's work known to the world.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:26.980
We can't be like this.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:29.150
You need to get better quickly.

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.170
Unfortunately.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:34.690
This is all for today's club activities. We have to leave school earlier than usual.

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:36.360
Huh? Why?

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.380
Why?

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.400
There's a test tomorrow.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:50.120
I completely forgot, there's a test tomorrow.

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:54.610
Well, it's just an achievement test, so it won't affect my grades...

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:59.180
Let's draw a few pictures and try to get closer to Ha-chan's level.

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:02.840
Ah, but I can't study coloring on my own.

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:06.800
It's as Iino-san said.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:13.940
I've just been copying manga, and paid no attention to things like sketching until recently.

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:16.300
Sketching...

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:22.360
This screen may be too small to sketch from it.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:26.850
If I transfer them...

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:29.140
Let's see, it's this file...

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:30.870
Now to print it...

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:34.310
Tama-chan, I got some loquat,
do you want some?

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.480
Thanks, Grandma, but not now.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:46.160
I-it's unexpectedly hard to draw yourself.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:48.230
I'm not pretty at all!

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:52.810
I'm actually quite short. I wish I were a bit taller.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.820
And somehow my hands look really rough!

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:58.760
It's because I've been drawing only old men.

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:02.490
Let's draw one more before studying for the test!

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:05.220
This time with a more difficult pose.

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.970
In the end, I kept drawing until I went to sleep.

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:45.520
But it's fine, it's just an achievement test.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:48.410
Yumine, how much did you study?

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:51.430
Don't talk to me, the formulas will fall out of my head.

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:55.620
I'll read through my notes at least.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:58.160
Honda-san...

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:03.070
Are you thinking of sending pictures to some shady place?

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:15.350
Good work. Classical literature's up next.

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:20.860
Those problems came up just the other day, and I even reviewed them.

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:23.530
I should have studied more.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:25.990
Let's switch to the next subject, Tama-chan.

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:28.330
Yes, change is important.

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:33.240
People have limitations. Flowers are beautiful because they are ephemeral.

00:21:33.890 --> 00:21:36.580
Was it hard to arrange your hair?

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:40.670
What's the matter?

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:45.010
After that message you got about your book, you felt such an intense mix of embarrassment

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.710
and joy that you couldn't study?

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:25.030
<i>Ah, Iris-sensei!</i>

00:23:25.030 --> 00:23:26.070
<i>Thank you for your message.</i>

00:23:26.070 --> 00:23:27.030
<i>It's a promise.</i>

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:28.150
<i>You broke it?</i>

00:23:29.170 --> 00:23:32.900
If it's your mother's wish, I'll do anything.
